    description: "Found by the 2026-11-07 docstring staleness audit (dev 4f2feb451b): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_11072026/review, verify and blind). Corpus impact not measured. _find_enclosing_context takes the innermost function_declaration (haxe.py:168-171) and mints an id (:180), but symbol extraction never descends into function bodies (:324). class Main { function run() { function inner() { helper(); } inner(); } } gives src haxe:Main.hx:3-5:Main.inner:fn, absent from the symbols; survey synthesizes it as an external_symbol. r24, v08."  # 0561
